and Welfare.”,\n(2) By deleting “ (12) Deputy Under Secretary for Legislative \nAffairs, Department of Commerce.” and inserting in lieu thereof “ (12) \nAssistant to the Secretary for Congressional Affairs, Department of \nCommerce.”,\n(3) By deleting “ (15) Commissioner General'of the Internation","path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/texts/EO_11831.txt","sha256":"2569207a301a7b4f6894a800f40549e8b522b26f317d1e9e21f559115a0e2b6b","source":{"line":1473,"path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"9286cf8ffc19b9da4f6173b20e1e2f42beac49ef43ae16a9b0f5a368449a9c72"}}]}
